 e minimum wage\, full time). Confirm before relying. Verify: set each ye
 ar by the agency. Source: https://www.dir.ca.gov/dlse/faq_minimumwage.ht
 m Prepared by Atlas One Solutions for Ridgeline Concrete LLC.
